133	     * {@code registrationDate}: {@code 'MINOR'} when under 18, {@code 'ADULT'} from 18 to 64 and
134	     * {@code 'SENIOR'} at 65 or over. Returns {@code null} when either date is absent, so owners
135	     * without a birthDate map cleanly.
