223	     * QLD 4000-4099), falling back to the city table, yielding {@code 'UNKNOWN'} when neither resolves
224	     * (see {@link org.springframework.samples.petclinic.rest.function.owner.MemberId#region}). This is
225	     * the same region embedded as the {@code REGION} segment of the owner's {@code memberId}, so
